                <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Data model Split&lt;/b&gt; &amp;mdash; allineato a &lt;i&gt;splitBack/prisma/schema.prisma&lt;/i&gt; (2026-09-26)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt; chiave primaria &amp;middot; &lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt; chiave esterna &amp;middot; &lt;b&gt;UK&lt;/b&gt; unique &amp;middot; &lt;b&gt;?&lt;/b&gt; nullable&lt;br&gt;Cardinalit&amp;agrave;: notazione crow's foot (lato FK = molti)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Vincoli composti&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; UserOnGroup: UNIQUE(groupId, userId)&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Category: UNIQUE(ownerId, name)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Note&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Category.ownerId NULL = categoria preconfigurata (ha &lt;i&gt;slug&lt;/i&gt;, niente &lt;i&gt;name&lt;/i&gt;); valorizzato = categoria custom dell'utente (ha &lt;i&gt;name&lt;/i&gt;, niente &lt;i&gt;slug&lt;/i&gt;). &lt;i&gt;archived&lt;/i&gt; = cancellazione soft.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Expense &amp;rarr; ExpenseContribution 1..N: il creatore &amp;egrave; sempre contributor (regola applicativa, non vincolo DB). paidBy deve essere uno dei contributor (idem).&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Expense.description NOT NULL, ma '' quando omessa. Expense.currency riservato alla V2.0.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; L'API espone solo i &lt;i&gt;publicId&lt;/i&gt;, mai gli &lt;i&gt;id&lt;/i&gt; interi." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;rounded=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#333333;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="840" width="1480" height="230" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
</mxfile>
